// The sheet's own mechanic is a self-centered aura the caster sustains
// while spending a bonus action each round to heal one nearby ally --
// approximated the same way this batch's prayer_of_healing.ron approximates
// a heal via `BasicAura`: the existing `Regeneration` BuffKind as a
// per-second tick, here genuinely sustained for the aura's real 60 s
// (Concentration(60) is kept as-is, not normalized to Instant, since this
// aura really does persist that long via `aura_duration`/`BuffData.duration`
// -- same real-sustain case as warding_wind.ron in this batch). Same
// same-school circle-3 `BasicAura` shape as
// assets/common/abilities/spells/gravesong/crusaders_mantle.ron (range 9 m,
// `InGroup`, energy 60), scaled slightly up (70) since this delivers
// ongoing health restoration rather than a flat damage buff.
BasicAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.6,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: Regeneration,
            strength: 3.0,
            duration: Some(60.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(60.0),
    range: 9.0,
    energy_cost: 70.0,
    scales_with_combo: false,
    specifier: Some(HealingAura),
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Divine)),
)
